  "title": "Capital Increase in Genmab as a Result of Employee Warrant Exercise",
  "summary": "Company Announcement COPENHAGEN, Denmark; June 16, 2026 – Genmab A/S (Nasdaq: GMAB) will increase its share capital by 185 shares as a consequence of the exercise of employee warrants. The increase is effected without any preemption rights for the existing shareholders of the Company or others.",
